# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# The Desktop is dressed from a window, not from an attribute set by
# hand: the pictures offered are the ones lying on the Desktop, choosing
# one shows it at once, and how it is laid is a choice beside it.
wait 15
key w ctrl
wait 5
click 980 20
wait 4
menu-pick Settings
wait 4
menu-pick TikuDesktop preferences
wait 12
expect-title TikuDesktop preferences
note the picture on the Desktop is offered, and choosing it shows it
expect-pixel 60 300 336698
click 400 161
wait 12
expect-pixel 60 300 10c810
note scaled stretches the corner over an eighth of the screen
expect-pixel 100 120 c81010
note tiled repeats the small picture instead, so the same point is field
click 350 371
wait 12
expect-pixel 100 120 10c810
note a press outside the row changes nothing.  It used to change the
note laying: the rows were bounded on y alone, so a click anywhere at
note that height -- including where nothing is drawn -- laid the
note wallpaper out again.  The rows are asked for whole now.
click 300 349
wait 12
expect-pixel 100 120 10c810
shot /tmp/trk_deskprefs_shot.png
wait 3
note and the icons have a size of their own, on a stepper of two buttons
note whose halves are asked for rather than guessed at: it was one string
note split at a written-down pixel, and which half a press landed in
note depended on the face the number happened to be drawn in
click 680 421
wait 10
expect-icon-at photos 42 25
note and the - beside it takes them back again
click 580 421
wait 10
expect-icon-at photos 29 20
note Reduce motion applies immediately and survives closing this window
expect-pixel 312 456 ffffff
click 370 456
wait 4
expect-pixel 312 456 000000
expect-same-as-redraw
key w ctrl
wait 3
click 980 20
wait 3
menu-pick Settings
wait 3
menu-pick TikuDesktop preferences
wait 5
expect-pixel 312 456 000000
note Defaults restores motion and Revert restores the reduced-motion baseline
click 350 529
wait 4
expect-pixel 312 456 ffffff
click 470 529
wait 4
expect-pixel 312 456 000000
expect-same-as-redraw
shot /tmp/trk_motion_preferences.png
quit
